[["heading","P R A C T I C A L  P R O J E C T  /  0 1\nInterview rehearsal: inventory and orders"],["text","Build a small catalog with a search box, pagination, and cart totals. Separate computation from the\nUI and API. Use sample data only."],["sinhala","","Product search එක, cart එක සහ CRUD API එක Jවන Jවනමෙ හදන්න. මුලින් functions වලට tests ලියලා පසුව frontend එක connect කරන්න.",493],["text","INPUT\nReact UI\nSearch & cart"],["text","STEP 1\nREST API\nValidate & authorize"],["text","STEP 2\nRepository\nDatabase"],["text","RESULT\nResponse\nRender result"],["heading","Tasks and acceptance criteria"],["heading","Task\nExpected behavior"],["text","Search\nCase-insensitive name filtering; no matches displays empty state."],["text","Cart\nDuplicate product IDs aggregate; use trusted integer prices."],["text","CRUD\nValidated body; 201 create, 404 missing, 204 deletion."],["text","Authorization\nGuest 401; non-admin 403; authorized user gets result."],["text","Pagination\nStable ID ordering, bounded limit, next cursor null at end."],["text","SQL\nJoin orders and customers; include customers with no orders."],["heading","Interview script"],["text","“I clarified inputs and outputs, wrote the smallest working implementation, then tested boundaries. I\nselected a map for grouping because expected lookup is constant time. I keep authorization and\nvalidation on the server.”"],["text","This is a project specification; the individual exercises provide snippets, not an integrated production\napplication."]]